WEBVTT

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.910
"U.E. 495"

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.580
Message! Official message!

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.160
His Majesty has announced our surrender!

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.870
Message! Official message!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.500
Damn it!

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.080
Stop!

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.790
Wolf!

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.500
Wolfran!

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:59.790
I wasn't able to stop Wolfran
from leaving the battlefield.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.660
U.E. 495.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:11.040
On that day, Ledrad's...
Our king, Olbany, took his own life.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.410
Even though soldiers were still
fighting on the front lines

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:19.000
to protect the kingdom... and the king.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.580
Suddenly, our war was over.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.450
Please...

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:52.040
I don't know what happened to him after that.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:59.700
Did I even understand him back when
we were fighting side by side?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:25.040
I probably don't know him well enough
to be able to say he's changed.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.910
Or anyone else, for that matter.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.500
"Episode 15"
"Weeding of Back Streets"

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.830
What can I get you?

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.250
Let's see...

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:31.580
Freeze!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.790
Dammit!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.160
Don't give us any trouble!

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:42.910
Everyone put your hands up!
Get down on your knees!

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.830
What the hell's the big idea?!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.160
Gail Dope.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.080
You know my name?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:53.040
We know all about you.
You're a member of Arcame.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.660
Never heard of it!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.250
Oh no?

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.450
Lily!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.790
Chase!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.700
They'd already cleared out.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.040
"Dorothea HQ"

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.830
Robert, good to see you.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:22.000
Thanks. So, you're back from Kal-o.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.450
We're back!

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:27.000
Why are you so cheerful?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.000
Beats being depressed.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.200
When did you guys get back from Hybranz?

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:34.410
The day before yesterday.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.000
Thanks for going.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.620
You too.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.500
How's your injury?

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.580
It's no big deal.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.540
Chima!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.080
How've you been?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.950
Looks like you had a rough time.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.620
For what purpose do you fight?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:06:00.660
What do you protect? Country? Comrades?

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.910
What will you have left?

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:07.370
I guess for now, we're taking down Arcame.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.000
I'd better report to the director.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.870
What happened?

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.410
What?

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.910
Nothing, ma'am.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.700
You look awful.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.120
You too, Director.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.660
How so?

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.620
Never mind...

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.370
I ran into Wolfran.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.500
And?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:35.330
He isn't with Arcame.

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.290
At least, not anymore.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.200
Did you talk to Chase?

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:45.160
He said when he questioned some guy named
Gail Dope, Wolfran's name came up.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.200
Apparently, Wolfran Row betrayed Arcame.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.450
Betrayed them?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:53.620
It really isn't clear when exactly he defected,

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:59.250
but there's no question that Arcame
considers Wolfran Row a traitor.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:05.790
Whatever Wolfran did, Schwarz Diese is dead
and Arcame is getting wiped out.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:10.330
It's hard to conclude he's acting on his own.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:13.750
And he happened to be there
when Duke Kal-o was attacked.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.620
There's no way that's a coincidence.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.870
Duke Kal-o...

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:24.500
First, we get rid of Arcame. And we'll
root out what's left of the Diese sect.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.000
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.620
Um, Director?

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.580
Is there something else?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:35.700
Marlya's childhood friend Veronica
is out to get Duke Kal-o.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.700
If it's not one thing, it's another...

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.040
I'm sorry.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.620
What will your apologizing accomplish?

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.830
Yes, ma'am...

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.250
Arcame has no absolute commander.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.040
It's broken up into sections.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:53.080
It has no leader?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.830
Although in an organization where
orders do come from the top,

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:59.450
all you have to do to get the
whole story is capture the top.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:03.700
We'll have to find each hideout
and shut them down as we go.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.500
Basically, yeah.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.200
Hey.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.200
Oh. Sorry, I thought you were someone else.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.160
What gives?

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.660
That guy looked like Axel, from behind.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:23.200
But not at all, in the face.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.870
I'm glad to see you in a good mood.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:26.620
What?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.540
Nothing.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.750
"Arcame mafia group member &amp; informant:
Axel Laboo"

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:36.830
That was good.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.120
Hello.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.410
Why?!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.250
Hi, Axel.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.500
Hey, man! You're looking well.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.040
Talk to us a minute.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.000
What if I refuse?

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:56.080
Starting tomorrow, you get to
eat bad prison food every day.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:09:00.950
Did you know? Believe it or not, I'm a gourmet.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:02.750
Get in there!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.080
Ow!

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.790
No need to push!

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:06.580
Pipe down.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.250
Axel! You punk!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:11.250
Well, well. If it isn't good ol' Gail.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.750
You got caught, huh? Dumb as ever, I see.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.910
You got caught too, you know!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:20.000
Huh? I'm...

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.120
Well, yeah, I did.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.040
Serves you right.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.450
You're an errand boy whose only merit
is that you can think on your feet.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:31.540
I don't wanna hear that from a coward
who wouldn't help attack the palace.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.080
Well what about <i>you</i> ?

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:38.160
Huh? Me? Well, I had reasons...

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.160
I have a lot of guys whose
stories I have to listen to.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:41.870
We're short on rooms. You two enjoy
each other's company for a while.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:42.830
Huh?!

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:45.370
You're kidding! Hey, man!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:53.620
Do you think we can use
Axel to extract information?

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.410
I'm not sure.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:59.000
Well, I guess... it's worth a try.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.080
Hey, as for today...

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.080
Let's call it a day already.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.040
There's still tomorrow.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.330
Good work today.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.540
Marlya.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.120
You can go for the day.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.500
Okay.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.200
Ouch.

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.950
A-Are you okay?

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.040
Yes, more or less.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.580
Hey, wake up.

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.250
Don't wanna.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.370
We'll leave you here.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.250
Go on, leave me.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.120
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:32.700
Whoa.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.910
Thanks.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.120
Sure.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.450
Got to get it together.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.540
We're just going home to go to sleep.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.000
True.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.790
Huh?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.410
Is something wrong?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:52.410
Well, I just noticed Chima's missing.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:54.660
I'll leave for the day, then.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.830
Right, good work today.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.120
You're not leaving yet?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.950
It's none of your concern.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.450
Where did you come from?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:17.620
Well, whatever.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.250
Hey, you guys! Breakfast?

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:45.080
You haven't been here lately, have you?

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.620
No, maybe not.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.830
Things have been so busy.

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.200
I'll bet.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.660
Well, drink up!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.160
It's <i>morning</i> .

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.160
Sir?

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:59.700
Huh? Oh, you guys are eating here too?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.750
Are you all right?

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:04.910
Yeah, it's my injury.
It's taking forever to heal.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.080
I'm not young anymore.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.660
What the hell'd you just say, squirt?

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.580
Good point.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:16.250
This might be none of my business,
but why not have Elenoa give you a full exam?

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.250
Yes, that would be best.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.450
Yeah.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.830
You aren't going to eat?

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.000
You guys hurry and finish up, too.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:36.370
Did something happen to him?

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.200
Maybe he's just tired?

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.620
"Dorothea HQ"
"Interrogation room"

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.330
Come on, Axel.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.830
You got it.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:57.870
It's been fun, good ol' Gail.
Thanks for all the stuff you told me.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:59.410
Don't waste your breath.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.290
Sorry about that.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:03.910
Punk! You were a spy!

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.870
I just know how to play my cards well.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.660
My only merit is I can think on my feet.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.580
"Rahn residence"

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:21.040
We're with Dorothea. Is Christoph Rahn in?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:28.000
I'm afraid my master is currently away.
If you'll excuse me.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.370
Let's just make sure of that.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.580
But, sir!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.160
Conduct a search!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.540
Hey!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.750
J-Just a moment, please!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:58.040
Nothing seems to be hidden.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:02.000
Well?

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.580
There's nothing that looks
like evidence, so far.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.000
Oh, Director.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:15.160
Christoph Rahn. The son of Olbany,
the last king of Ledrad.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.870
Christoph Rahn is not the queen's child,

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:23.410
but the Rahn family is appointed suitable rank,
such as that of bureaucrat.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:27.450
And yet, he supported a group of rebels.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:32.160
Schwarz Diese infiltrated the palace
using an underground passage

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.330
of which the unified government was unaware.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.660
The palace was once the royal palace of Ledrad.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.700
As royalty, it's no surprise
he would know its layout.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:44.290
Christoph informed Diese
about the underground passage.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:47.750
That's information we got out
of an Arcame member we arrested,

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.950
so we have yet to corroborate it.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:55.620
But given how Christoph himself
has disappeared, it does seem rather credible.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.700
It's safe to say he's the foremost
of the rebels, after Diese.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.580
I want him in custody.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.040
Yes, we will track him down.

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:12.450
Are you on the job too? Much appreciated.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:21.160
Oh, gotcha. Then, do you know anyone
around here who's in the know?

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:23.120
Sure, maybe I do.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:27.250
Introduce me. I'll make sure
it's no trouble for you.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:32.120
At least the way he gets in good
with people is worthy of respect.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.250
Christoph Rahn?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.120
He's pretty famous.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.410
And his face?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.500
I <i>think</i> I'd recognize him.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:46.660
This area is ideal for hiding out, after all.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.290
Sorry to trouble you.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.120
Don't you and I go way back?

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:53.500
Yeah, that we do.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:02.950
Robert Chase, formerly with the
Security Bureau, has his eye on the area.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:07.410
He's shrewd, all right. About as shrewd as I am.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.450
"Dorothea HQ"

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.580
Ayoomph.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:20.250
We have to read all these...

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:27.040
You reported that I chased after Ver,
but that she then got away, right?

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.750
That's not incorrect, is it?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:33.410
Nothing good comes of my getting involved.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:34.660
Never has.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.660
Are you looking for sympathy?

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.790
That's not what I...

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:45.410
Sorry.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:50.200
It's okay. I'm sorry too.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.040
What a heavy... load to bear.

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:10.620
No appetite? For that matter, you seem troubled.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.200
Does it look that way?

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:14.910
Frankly, it does.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:17.200
Oh. Yeah...

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.580
It's just, I guess...

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:24.580
I wonder if I'm holding everyone back.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:27.540
That's all it is, though.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.790
You're feeling responsible.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:37.080
For instance, do you still feel like it's
your fault Ozz wound up dead?

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:40.080
Well, actually, I do.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.330
For a long time now, various things
have happened because of me.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:48.750
Wow, you're important.
Or is it more like, you're a big shot?

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.120
I mean, it's as if you're
the center of the world.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:56.040
If making everything your fault
makes it all work out somehow...

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.330
...that's amazing.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:58.370
You shouldn't talk like--

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:01.330
Ozz... was different.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.950
It wasn't your fault that he died.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:08.910
I think Free said this before,
but he laid down his life for you.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:12.160
Or rather, he did it for a comrade.

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:18.370
I think Ozz would have risked his life
to protect Klara, or me. Not just you.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.750
That's the way he was.

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:25.500
We have to do all we can to enjoy
the life we've been given.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.040
Or else it's a waste.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.500
We're your comrades.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:34.700
Can't you trust us?

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.200
Why not eat?

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.870
It's good.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.000
Cheers.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.450
You're covered in wounds.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.910
There's not a single spot that looks good.

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:13.700
That's a mean thing to say.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.580
Why don't you take some time off?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.950
Once everything's taken care of.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.660
And when will that happen?

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:25.500
Come in!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:29.200
Uh, oops...

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.790
What're you thinking?!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.620
Sorry, but come with me.

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:34.500
What's up?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.700
Christoph Rahn's been discovered.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.450
Axel?!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.750
No doubt about it. That's Christoph Rahn.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:02.120
Who discovered him?

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.250
I did.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:07.410
I'd heard multiple reports of him
being spotted around here.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:11.750
I thought I was close to
pinpointing his hideout, but...

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:16.870
Well, when it comes to convenient
places to hide oneself in Rondacia...

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.160
So, some people said they
thought they heard a gunshot?

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.620
Yeah, right after it got dark.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.450
Several of those who live near here.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.870
But they don't want to get involved,
and they paid it no mind.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.250
That was placed in his hand. It wasn't suicide.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.750
So, he was killed off.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.200
Who did it?

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:40.040
That's why I wasn't sure if I should tell you.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.830
The first one on the scene
always gets suspected.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:46.540
I know for a fact this guy was
also looking for Christoph Rahn.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:50.330
I didn't know he was connected
to Dorothea, and it made me nervous.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.450
I'm a collaborator!

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.250
I knew I'd be suspected,
and I <i>could</i> have just run off.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.910
The reason I didn't was
because I figured it'd pay off

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:01.370
to take good care of my
relationship with you guys.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.410
Go ahead and restrain him.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.620
Hey, nothin' points to it being me!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:08.700
Be quiet.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.250
Hey! That hurts!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.140
Don't struggle.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:11.950
What do you think?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.080
Let me go!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:15.250
Well, he does tend to be self-serving.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.040
Schwarz Diese...

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:23.700
In the wake of your struggle,
nothing will remain.

00:22:55.870 --> 00:23:01.580
You've been an errand boy for
Colonel Liscar for a while now?

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:03.450
You knew, after all?

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:08.040
Of course. Would I meet with
the likes of you, otherwise?

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:11.450
You want to get in touch with the colonel?

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:15.830
Yeah, that's right.
With his backing, it'd still be--

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:18.450
The colonel won't meet with you.

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.750
What?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:21.830
Or rather, he can't.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:25.790
You know too much, and you
might even put me in danger.

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.290
How dare you!

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:29.790
You've got to know the score in life.

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:32.500
That's my motto, you see!

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:40.540
Looks like someone beat me to it.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:42.750
Care to fight alongside me?

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:45.410
Don't do it! He has a Fairy Weapon!

00:23:45.410 --> 00:23:46.000
Ver!

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:48.500
"Next time"
"Kite Laughing Out Loud"

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:46.750
Ver!

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:48.500
I'll determine the rules.
